<title>FRANCE: UPS France makes logistics appointment.</title>
<headline>UPS France makes logistics appointment.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Parcel Service France said it had appointed Partick Perrin to the newly-created post of general manager, UPS Worldwide Logistics France, effective earlier this week.</p>
<p>Perrin, 50, was previously  general manager Logistics at Danzas France.</p>
<p>UPS Worldwide Logistics France was set up at the end of 1996 and followed the creation of logistics services subsidiaries in the UK and Holland. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
